om the gate, dying to uphold his convictions.","jp":"劉璋の部将で、死を賭した諫言で知られる忠臣。劉備を蜀に迎え入れぬよう諫めるため城門に逆さ吊りとなったが、劉璋は頑として聞き入れなかった。これを見た王累は、自ら縄を断ち切って転落死し、死をもってその志を示した。","kr":"유장의 부하로, 목숨을 건 간언으로 널리 알려진 충의의 신하이다. 유비의 입촉을 만류하고자 성문에 거꾸로 매달려 결사적으로 간언했으나, 유장은 고집을 꺾지 않고 끝내 받아들이지 않았다. 이에 왕루는 스스로 밧줄을 끊고 성 아래로 투신하여 목숨으로 충정을 증명했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10598","remark":"","surname":"王","surnameTc":"王","surnameEn":"Wang","surnameJp":"王","surnameKr":"왕","surnameOther":"","name":"累","nameTc":"累","nameEn":"Lei","nameJp":"累","nameKr":"루","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"王累","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"192","city":"CS1040","gender":"0","rule":"28","force":"30","wise":"79","politics":"80","charm":"45","will":"89","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"10","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"8/8/8/8/8/76/20/8","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1015805","debateSoul":"1002205","warSoulPoint":"700","battleSoulPoint":"900","debateSoulPoint":"6200","strategy":"","strategy2":"1009601","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/2/2/0/0/0/0/0/3/1/2/2/0/1/0/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"7","compatible":"38","loyalty":"0","reputation":"4200","evaluate":"5000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"173","show":"192","death":"211","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014105","helmet":"WP1028305","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/2;8/1;12/2;18/3;31/1;26/1;27/3","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"